{"id":"634d28e30ada0b29","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-smullyan-induction.md","title":"The Book’s Wrapped Induction Scheme N12","display":"df-smullyan-induction — The Book’s Wrapped Induction Scheme N12","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-smullyan-induction","aliases":["92-df-smullyan-induction"],"display":"df-smullyan-induction — The Book’s Wrapped Induction Scheme N12","source":"第 III 章 pp. 29–30（PDF 46–47）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-smullyan-free-variables]]","[[92-df-smullyan-wrapped-instance]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-smullyan-induction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-smullyan-induction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-smullyan-induction — The Book’s Wrapped Induction Scheme N12"},{"key":"source","html":"第 III 章 pp. 29–30（PDF 46–47）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"72f7b5109e33fa0f\" href=\"?note=72f7b5109e33fa0f\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-free-variables\">92-df-smullyan-free-variables</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6deaff22ee062525\" href=\"?note=6deaff22ee062525\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-wrapped-instance\">92-df-smullyan-wrapped-instance</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{E,J}\">\\(F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{E,J}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\\in\\{\\{1,2\\},\\{1,2,3\\}\\}\">\\(J\\in\\{\\{1,2\\},\\{1,2,3\\}\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\geq2\">\\(i\\geq2\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_i^E\\notin\\mathrm{Occ}_E(F)\">\\(v_i^E\\notin\\mathrm{Occ}_E(F)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_E(F,0)\">\\(W_E(F,0)\\)</span> 是原书 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F[\\bar0]\">\\(F[\\bar0]\\)</span> 的包裹串，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6deaff22ee062525\" href=\"?note=6deaff22ee062525\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-wrapped-instance\">92-df-smullyan-wrapped-instance</a>；全部构造器沿用原书串文法。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StepWrap}_{E,i},\\operatorname{IndInst}_{E,i},\\mathrm{Ind}_{E,J}\">\\(\\operatorname{StepWrap}_{E,i},\\operatorname{IndInst}_{E,i},\\mathrm{Ind}_{E,J}\\)</span> 是待定义的构造器和实例集。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}induction}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{StepWrap}_{E,i}(F)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\forall v_i^E\\bigl(v_i^E=(v_1^E)&#39;\\supset\n\\forall v_1^E(v_1^E=v_i^E\\supset F)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{IndInst}_{E,i}(F)&amp;\\coloneqq W_E(F,0)\\supset\n\\bigl(\\forall v_1^E(F\\supset\\operatorname{StepWrap}_{E,i}(F))\\supset\n\\forall v_1^E F\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Ind}_{E,J}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\operatorname{IndInst}_{E,i}(F):F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{E,J},\\ i\\geq2,\\ v_i^E\\notin\\mathrm{Occ}_E(F)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}induction}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{StepWrap}_{E,i}(F)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\forall v_i^E\\bigl(v_i^E=(v_1^E)&#39;\\supset\n\\forall v_1^E(v_1^E=v_i^E\\supset F)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{IndInst}_{E,i}(F)&amp;\\coloneqq W_E(F,0)\\supset\n\\bigl(\\forall v_1^E(F\\supset\\operatorname{StepWrap}_{E,i}(F))\\supset\n\\forall v_1^E F\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Ind}_{E,J}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\operatorname{IndInst}_{E,i}(F):F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{E,J},\\ i\\geq2,\\ v_i^E\\notin\\mathrm{Occ}_E(F)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书故意用双层量词包装 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F[v_1&#39;]\">\\(F[v_1&#39;]\\)</span>，绕开一般项代入的算术化。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 可有自由参数，不要求只有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_1^E\">\\(v_1^E\\)</span> 自由。新变量取与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_1^E\">\\(v_1^E\\)</span> 不同且完全不出现的变量，总能做到；这里把这一选择条件写明，以保证包装等价于所说的后继实例。</p>\n<p>底步 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F[\\bar0]\">\\(F[\\bar0]\\)</span> 也使用量词包装，不能按字符串把它等同于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(0)\">\\(F(0)\\)</span>。按标准自然数解释，两者等价，IndInst 是正确公式。上面的系统定义采用全部安全新变量所得实例，不假定它们是同一个原始字符串。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-smullyan-free-variables","status":"resolved","id":"72f7b5109e33fa0f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-free-variables]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-wrapped-instance","status":"resolved","id":"6deaff22ee062525","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-wrapped-instance]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-wrapped-instance","status":"resolved","id":"6deaff22ee062525","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$W_E(F,0)$ 是原书 $F[\\bar0]$ 的包裹串，见 [[92-df-smullyan-wrapped-instance]]；全部构造器沿用原书串文法。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{E,J}","display":false},{"tex":"J\\in\\{\\{1,2\\},\\{1,2,3\\}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"i\\geq2","display":false},{"tex":"v_i^E\\notin\\mathrm{Occ}_E(F)","display":false},{"tex":"W_E(F,0)","display":false},{"tex":"F[\\bar0]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{StepWrap}_{E,i},\\operatorname{IndInst}_{E,i},\\mathrm{Ind}_{E,J}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}induction}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{StepWrap}_{E,i}(F)&\\coloneqq\n\\forall v_i^E\\bigl(v_i^E=(v_1^E)'\\supset\n\\forall v_1^E(v_1^E=v_i^E\\supset F)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{IndInst}_{E,i}(F)&\\coloneqq W_E(F,0)\\supset\n\\bigl(\\forall v_1^E(F\\supset\\operatorname{StepWrap}_{E,i}(F))\\supset\n\\forall v_1^E F\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Ind}_{E,J}&\\coloneqq\n\\{\\operatorname{IndInst}_{E,i}(F):F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{E,J},\\ i\\geq2,\\ v_i^E\\notin\\mathrm{Occ}_E(F)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"F[v_1']","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"v_1^E","display":false},{"tex":"v_1^E","display":false},{"tex":"F[\\bar0]","display":false},{"tex":"F(0)","display":false}],"bytes":1953,"backlinks":[{"id":"ffee1dd616b0911b","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书将 A(x) 拆成十九个模式的算术公式。本文 Axiom_F 是通用码成员关系，任意系统的公理集并不自动有效；原书的明确模式见 [[92-df-smullyan-logical-axioms]]、[[92-ax-smullyan-arithmetic]] 和 [[92-df-smullyan-induction]]。"},{"id":"920841c1841d30c3","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-23","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-logical-axioms]]、[[92-ax-smullyan-arithmetic]]、[[92-df-smullyan-induction]] → [[92-df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems]] → [[92-df-smullyan-sequence-code]] → [[92-df-smullyan-proof-code]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-correctness]]。L7 采用完整变量叶的单出现递归；N12 采用原书双层量词包装。"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-125","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-induction]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-176","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-induction]]"}],"outgoing":["72f7b5109e33fa0f","6deaff22ee062525"]}